      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's see why this knife is special.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Почему нельзя купить такой нож?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why can't we buy such a knife?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "По-быстрому такой нож купить не получится.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You can't buy such a knife in a hurry.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "А сколько он стоит?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And how much does it cost?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Это дорогой японский нож.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is an expensive Japanese knife.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Шеф заказывал его очень долго.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The chef ordered it for a very long time.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "И он очень острый?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And is it very sharp?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Самый острый нож на кухне.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The sharpest knife in the kitchen.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Где же он может быть?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Where could it possibly be?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Мы уже везде искали.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We already looked everywhere.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Может, кто-то взял его домой?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Maybe someone took it home?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Никто не посмеет это сделать.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Nobody would dare do that.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Шеф сразу всех уволит.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The chef will fire everyone immediately.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Давай нож ищи скорее.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Come on, look for the knife quickly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
